(20006, '107144318', 'Ministry of Railways', 'Ministry of Railways', '04-Aug-2026 03:33 PM', '17-Sep-2026 02:30 PM', '17-Sep-2026 02:30 PM', 'RAPID TESTS FOR DENGUE IGM [SRPHC82670270-RAPID TESTS FOR DENGUE IGM: 1.TEST SHOULD BE A SOLID PHASE IN VITRO IMMUNO CHROMATOGRAPHIC TEST BASED ON LATERAL FLOW TECHNIQUE. 2. TEST MUST BE ABLE TO DETECT IGM ANTIBODIES AGAINST ALL FOUR SEROTYPES OF DENGUE VIRUS. 3. SHOULD HAVE SHORT INTERPRETATION TIME NOT MORE THAN 30 MINUTES. 4.SHOULD HAVE IN BUILT QUALITY CONTROL BAND. 5.DENGUE IGM : SENSITIVITY 95 Percent , SPECIFICITY GREATER THAN AND EQUAL TO 95 Percent . 6.THE KIT SHOULD HAVE A SHELF-LIFE', '02265837', 'Ministry of Railways (Ministry of Railways)', '{\"Name\": \"STORES/SOUTHERN RLY\", \"EMD *\": \"0\", \"Address\": \"Office of the Principal Chief Materials Manager New Joint Office,Ayanavaram Chennai\", \"Location\": \"Chennai\", \"Tender Type\": \"Open/Advertised\", \"Tender Title\": \"RAPID TESTS FOR DENGUE IGM [SRPHC82670270-RAPID TESTS FOR DENGUE IGM: 1.TEST SHOULD BE A SOLID PHASE IN VITRO IMMUNO CHROMATOGRAPHIC TEST BASED ON LATERAL FLOW TECHNIQUE. 2. TEST MUST BE ABLE TO DETECT IGM ANTIBODIES AGAINST ALL FOUR SEROTYPES OF DENGUE VIRUS. 3. SHOULD HAVE SHORT INTERPRETATION TIME NOT MORE THAN 30 MINUTES. 4.SHOULD HAVE IN BUILT QUALITY CONTROL BAND. 5.DENGUE IGM : SENSITIVITY 95 Percent , SPECIFICITY GREATER THAN AND EQUAL TO 95 Percent . 6.THE KIT SHOULD HAVE A SHELF-LIFE\", \"Tender Fee *\": \"0\", \"Tender Category\": \"Goods\", \"Tender Document\": \"https://www.ireps.gov.in/ireps/supply/pdfdocs/092026/107144318/viewNitPdf_5498618.pdf\", \"ePublished Date\": \"04-Aug-2026 03:33 PM\", \"Bid Opening Date\": \"17-Sep-2026 02:30 PM\", \"Product Category\": \"Railway related Products\", \"Work Description\": \"For complete deion and other details, please refer to tender\", \"Organisation Name\": \"Ministry of Railways\", \"Organisation Type\": \"Central Govt. Ministry/Department\", \"Product Sub-Category\": \"\", \"Bid S